      "retrieved_at": "2026-09-07T22:07:26.090619+00:00",
      "source_id": "source-3",
      "start_char": 59777,
      "text": "(Exact name of registrant as specified in its charter)",
      "text_sha256": "83c9ba74048e5a956ba8180409324361523cafc335d3b988dae1124b8086a332",
      "title": null,
      "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1375365/000137536526000022/smci-20260630.htm"
    },
    {
      "corpus": "web",
      "coverage": "captured_document",
      "end_char": 247731,
      "passage_id": "source-3:p654",
      "published_at": null,
      "publisher": "www.sec.gov",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-09-07T22:07:26.090619+00:00",
      "source_id": "source-3",
      "start_char": 247378,
      "text": "Our common stock is traded on the Nasdaq Global Select Market under the symbol SMCI. Public trading of our common stock began on March 29, 2007. Prior to that, there was no public market for our common stock. Our Mandatory Convertible Preferred Stock in the form of depositary shares are listed on the Nasdaq Global Select Market under the symbol SMCIP.",
      "text_sha256": "aacb108b857f24441249a28af1244cb1ab93ad5b6ff2a78b846ed477850f856c",
      "title": null,
      "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1375365/000137536526000022/smci-20260630.htm"
    },
    {
      "corpus": "web",
      "coverage": "captured_document",
      "end_char": 112398,
      "passage_id": "source-3:p308",
      "published_at": null,
      "publisher": "www.sec.gov",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-09-07T22:07:26.090619+00:00",
      "source_id": "source-3",
      "start_char": 111813,
      "text": "We were incorporated in California in September 1993 and subsequently reincorporated in Delaware in March 2007. Our common stock is listed on the Nasdaq Global Select Market under the symbol “SMCI”. Our 7.00% Series A Mandatory Convertible Preferred Stock (the “Mandatory Convertible Preferred Stock”) in the form of depositary shares are listed on the Nasdaq Global Select Market under the ticker “SMCIP”. Our principal executive offices are located at 980 Rock Avenue, San Jose, California 95131. Our telephone number is (408) 503-8000, and our website address is www.supermicro.com.",
      "text_sha256": "d2386c07f325e3dfe85e0eb1a0d3f3256df113eb4ef99b7d53a2f423309eb21d",
      "title": null,
      "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1375365/000137536526000022/smci-20260630.htm"
    },
    {
      "corpus": "web",
      "coverage": "captured_document",
      "end_char": 64115,
      "passage_id": "source-3:p91",
      "published_at": null,
      "publisher": "www.sec.gov",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-09-07T22:07:26.090619+00:00",
      "source_id": "source-3",
      "start_char": 63934,
      "text": "As of July 31, 2026, there were 656,965,384 shares of the registrant’s common stock, $0.001 par value, outstanding, which is the only class of common stock of the registrant issued.",
      "text_sha256": "a25a5359acad0848fabb080309a0c9a78c81e976f1afaf7d171e6e5c940c118c",
      "title": null,
      "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1375365/000137536526000022/smci-20260630.htm"
    },
    {
      "corpus": "web",
      "coverage": "captured_document",
      "end_char": 1604,
      "passage_id": "source-1:p53",
      "published_at": null,
      "publisher": "markets.financialcontent.com",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-09-07T22:05:11.073978+00:00",
      "source_id": "source-1",
      "start_char": 904,
      "text": "In a pivotal turn of events for the AI infrastructure sector, Super Micro Computer (Nasdaq: SMCI) has successfully averted a catastrophic delisting from the Nasdaq exchange by filing its long-overdue financial reports. As of January 27, 2026, the company is back in full regulatory compliance, marking the end of a tumultuous eighteen-month period characterized by auditor resignations, internal probes, and intense federal scrutiny. While the filing brings much-needed legal stability, the immediate market reaction has been defined by sharp volatility as investors grapple with the company’s severely compressed profit margins and the \"governance discount\" that continues to weigh on its valuation.",
      "text_sha256": "2031da9b69883a8ad849c8ab5f089706f93e6c2497e3bbaac37926207abac72e",
      "title": null,
      "url": "https://markets.financialcontent.com/franklincredit/article/marketminute-2026-1-27-super-micro-computer-smci-regains-nasdaq-compliance-after-high-stakes-accounting-saga-igniting-fresh-market-volatility"
    },
    {
      "corpus": "web",
      "coverage": "captured_document",
      "end_char": 706,
      "passage_id": "source-1:p48",
      "published_at": null,
      "publisher": "markets.financialcontent.com",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-09-07T22:05:11.073978+00:00",
      "source_id": "source-1",
      "start_char": 585,
      "text": "Super Micro Computer (SMCI) Regains Nasdaq Compliance After High-Stakes Accounting Saga, Igniting Fresh Market Volatility",
      "text_sha256": "9dc2315130af5dad28e0c1473d8884f14762a5ff0bab0560f155577e9965f58f",
      "title": null,
      "url": "https://markets.financialcontent.com/franklincredit/article/marketminute-2026-1-27-super-micro-computer-smci-regains-nasdaq-compliance-after-high-stakes-accounting-saga-igniting-fresh-market-volatility"
    },
    {
      "corpus": "web",
      "coverage": "captured_document",
      "end_char": 623,
      "passage_id": "source-2:p7",
      "published_at": null,
      "publisher": "www.sec.gov",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-09-07T22:05:44.844503+00:00",
      "source_id": "source-2",
      "start_char": 178,
      "text": "SAN JOSE, Calif., February 26, 2025 – Super Micro Computer, Inc. (Nasdaq:SMCI) (“SMCI” or the “Company”), a Total IT Solution Provider for AI, Cloud, Storage and 5G/Edge, today announced that on February 25, 2025 it received a notification letter from Nasdaq indicating that it now complies with Nasdaq Listing Rule 5250(c)(1) which requires timely filing of reports with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission and the matter is now closed.",
      "text_sha256": "079962733c1d7ea0fde1a27a82668630cc942c88b3eb28a004f9316c378e9672",
      "title": null,
      "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1375365/000137536525000007/smci-nasdaqletterprfeb2025.htm"
    }
  ],
